    "caption": "Business expenses kya hote hain? 💸\n\nBusiness chalane ke liye jo paisa kharch hota hai, woh expense hai. Rent jaise costs fixed ho sakte hain; ingredients jaise costs sales ke saath badal sakte hain.\n\nDono ko track karna pricing aur profit samajhne mein help karta hai.\n\nAgli post: Revenue vs Profit.\n\n#BusinessJalwa #BusinessBasics #BusinessExpenses #BusinessInHinglish",
