    "publish_at": "2026-11-01T18:00:00+05:30",
    "caption": "Revenue aur profit same nahi hote. 📊\n\nRevenue = total sales income. Profit = revenue mein se expenses ghataane ke baad bacha paisa.\n\nExample: ₹8,000 revenue − ₹6,500 expenses = ₹1,500 profit (tax se pehle).\n\nAgli post: Profit Margin.\n\n#BusinessJalwa #Revenue #Profit #BusinessInHinglish",
