    "caption": "Profit margin batata hai ki revenue ka kitna hissa profit bana. 📈\n\nFormula: Net Profit ÷ Revenue × 100\n\nExample: ₹10,000 revenue aur ₹1,000 net profit = 10% margin.\n\nIndustry ke hisaab se margins alag ho sakte hain.\n\nAgli post: Cash Flow.\n\n#BusinessJalwa #ProfitMargin #BusinessBasics #BusinessInHinglish",
