    "caption": "ROE yani Return on Equity. 📊\n\nYe batata hai company shareholders ki equity ke muqable kitna profit kama rahi hai.\n\nFormula: Net Profit ÷ Average Shareholders’ Equity × 100\n\nROE ko same industry ki companies aur multiple years ke context mein dekho; high ROE akela poori picture nahi batata.\n\nAgli post: P/E Ratio.\n\n#BusinessJalwa #ROE #FinanceTerms #BusinessInHinglish",
