    "caption": "P/E yani Price-to-Earnings ratio. 📈\n\nFormula: Share price ÷ Earnings Per Share (EPS)\n\nExample: ₹200 share price ÷ ₹10 EPS = P/E 20. Matlab share price annual EPS ka 20 guna hai.\n\nHigh P/E automatic good ya bad nahi—similar companies, growth aur profits ke saath compare karo. Ye akela buy/sell signal nahi hai.\n\nAgli series: Company Stories.\n\n#BusinessJalwa #PERatio #FinanceTerms #BusinessInHinglish",
